==Additional Items==
When players receive characters and Light Cones from Warps, they also receive {{Item|Undying Embers}} and/or {{Item|Undying Starlight}}. These items can be traded in the Store to obtain other items.

When players receive a duplicate character, they also receive [[Eidolon (Item)|Eidolon]] items, used to activate [[Eidolon]]s of characters.

When players receive a duplicate 5-star character with maxed Eidolons, they also receive a {{Item|Silver Companion Spirit}}, used to exchange for {{Item|Golden Companion Spirit|text=Golden Companion Spirits}} in the [[Stellar Convergence]] shop.

